wer":"The address of the borrower associated with the loan.","epoch":"The epoch during which the rewards were paid.","tokenId":"The ID of the token representing the loan."}},"RewardsReceived(uint256,uint256,address,uint256)":{"details":"Emitted when rewards are received for a loan.","params":{"amount":"The amount of rewards received.","borrower":"The address of the borrower receiving the rewards.","epoch":"The epoch during which the rewards were received.","tokenId":"The ID of the token representing the loan."}},"Upgraded(address)":{"details":"Emitted when the implementation is upgraded."},"VeNftIncreased(address,uint256,uint256)":{"details":"Emitted when a user's veNFT balance is increased.","params":{"amount":"The amount by which the veNFT balance is increased.","tokenId":"The ID of the veNFT token.","user":"The address of the user whose veNFT balance is increased."}},"ZeroBalanceOptionSet(uint256,uint8)":{"details":"Emitted when the zero balance option is set for a loan.","params":{"option":"The zero balance option set for the loan.","tokenId":"The ID of the token representing the loan."}}},"kind":"dev","methods":{"acceptOwnership()":{"details":"The new owner accepts the ownership transfer."},"activeAssets()":{"details":"This function returns the value of `_outstandingCapital`, which represents the total active loans.","returns":{"_0":"The total amount of active assets."}},"claim(uint256,address[],address[][])":{"details":"This function retrieves rewards for the given token ID, calculates protocol fees,      lender premiums, and handles zero balance scenarios based on the loan's configuration.","params":{"fees":"An array of addresses representing the fee tokens to be claimed.","tokenId":"The ID of the loan (NFT) for which rewards are being claimed.","tokens":"A two-dimensional array of addresses representing the tokens to be swapped to the asset."}},"claimCollateral(uint256)":{"details":"This function ensures that only the borrower can claim the collateral and that the loan is fully repaid.      If the loan balance is greater than zero, the collateral cannot be claimed.","params":{"tokenId":"The ID of the loan (NFT) whose collateral is being claimed."}},"getLenderPremium()":{"details":"This function checks the lender premium stored in the RateStorage contract.      If the lender premium is not set (returns 0), it defaults to 20%.","returns":{"_0":"The lender premium percentage (in basis points, where 2000 = 20%)."}},"getLoanDetails(uint256)":{"details":"This function returns the balance, borrower address, and pools associated with the loan.","params":{"tokenId":"The ID of the loan (NFT)."},"returns":{"balance":"The current balance of the loan.","borrower":"The address of the borrower.","pools":"An array of addresses representing the pools associated with the loan."}},"getManagedNft()":{"details":"Get the managed NFT for the loan contract"},"getMaxLoan(uint256)":{"details":"This function considers the veNFT balance, rewards rate, vault utilization, and current loan balance.","params":{"tokenId":"The ID of the loan (NFT)."},"returns":{"_0":"maxLoan The maximum loan amount that can be borrowed.","_1":"maxLoanIgnoreSupply The maximum loan amount ignoring vault supply constraints."}},"getProtocolFee()":{"details":"This function checks the protocol fee stored in the RateStorage contract.      If the protocol fee is not set (returns 0), it defaults to 5%.","returns":{"_0":"The protocol fee percentage (in basis points, where 500 = 5%)."}},"getRewardsRate()":{"details":"This function checks the rewards rate stored in the RateStorage contract.      If the rewards rate is not set (returns 0), it defaults to 113 (11.3%).","returns":{"_0":"The rewards rate percentage (in basis points, where 113 = 1.13%)."}},"getSwapper()":{"details":"Get the swapper address for the loan contract"},"getTotalWeight()":{"details":"Get the total weight for the loan contract"},"getZeroBalanceFee()":{"details":"This function checks the zero balance fee stored in the RateStorage contract.      If the zero balance fee is not set (returns 0), it defaults to 1%.","returns":{"_0":"The zero balance fee percentage (in basis points, where 100 = 1%)."}},"incentivizeVault(uint256)":{"details":"This function requires the caller to have approved the contract to transfer the specified amount of USDC.","params":{"amount":"The amount of USDC to transfer to the vault and record as rewards."}},"increaseAmount(uint256,uint256)":{"details":"This function locks tokens into the veNFT associated with the given token ID.","params":{"amount":"The amount of tokens to be added to the veNFT.","tokenId":"The ID of the veNFT whose amount is to be increased."}},"increaseLoan(uint256,uint256)":{"details":"Increases the loan amount for a given tokenId by a specified amount.      The function checks if the token is locked, if the amount is valid,      and if the borrower is the one requesting the increase.","params":{"amount":"The amount to increase the loan by. Must be greater than .01 USDC.","tokenId":"The ID of the loan for which the amount is being increased."}},"isApprovedToken(address)":{"details":"Check if the token is approved for the loan contract"},"lastEpochReward()":{"details":"This function returns the total rewards recorded for the current epoch.","returns":{"_0":"The total rewards for the current epoch."}},"merge(uint256)":{"details":"This function can only be called by the owner of the contract.      Note: This should only be possible for Flight School rewards sent to the contract.","params":{"tokenId":"The ID of the token to merge with the managed NFT. ManagedNFT is essentially a community owned veNFT where users can increase the NFT to obtain shares In the future this can be used as collateral for loans"}},"owner()":{"details":"Returns the address of the current owner."},"pay(uint256,uint256)":{"details":"If the `amount` parameter is set to 0, the entire remaining loan balance will be paid.      The function transfers the specified `amount` of USDC from the caller to the contract      and then processes the payment.","params":{"amount":"The amount of USDC to pay. If set to 0, the full loan balance will be paid.","tokenId":"The unique identifier of the loan."}},"payMultiple(uint256[])":{"details":"Allows the borrower to pay off their loan in multiple transactions.      This function iterates through an array of token IDs and calls the pay function for each one. ","params":{"tokenIds":"An array of token IDs representing the loans to be paid off."}},"pendingOwner()":{"details":"Returns the address of the pending owner."},"proxiableUUID()":{"details":"Implementation of the ERC-1822 {proxiableUUID} function. This returns the storage slot used by the implementation. It is used to validate the implementation's compatibility when performing an upgrade. IMPORTANT: A proxy pointing at a proxiable contract should not be considered proxiable itself, because this risks bricking a proxy that upgrades to it, by delegating to itself until out of gas. Thus it is critical that this function revert if invoked through a proxy. This is guaranteed by the `notDelegated` modifier."},"requestLoan(uint256,uint256,uint8,uint256,address,bool,bool)":{"details":"The function ensures that the token is locked permanently and transfers ownership of the token      to the contract. It also initializes loan details for the token and optionally increases the loan amount.","params":{"amount":"The amount of the loan to be requested. If 0, no loan amount is added initially.","tokenId":"The ID of the token to be used as collateral.","zeroBalanceOption":"The option specifying how zero balance scenarios should be handled."}},"setApprovedToken(address,bool)":{"details":"Set approved token for the loan contract"},"setDefaultPools(address[],uint256[])":{"details":"The pools must have valid gauges, and the weights must sum up to 100e18 (100%).      Updates the default pool change time to the current block timestamp.","params":{"pools":"An array of addresses representing the default pools.","weights":"An array of uint256 values representing the weights of the pools."}},"setManagedNft(uint256)":{"details":"Transfers the NFT from the sender to the contract, updates the managed NFT state","params":{"tokenId":"The ID of the NFT to be managed by the contract."}},"setMultiplier(uint256)":{"details":"This function can only be called by the owner of the contract.","params":{"multiplier":"The new multiplier value to be set."}},"setSwapper(address)":{"details":"Set the swapper address for the loan contract"},"transferOwnership(address)":{"details":"Starts the ownership transfer of the contract to a new account. Replaces the pending transfer if there is one. Can only be called by the current owner. Setting `newOwner` to the zero address is allowed; this can be used to cancel an initiated ownership transfer."},"upgradeToAndCall(address,bytes)":{"custom:oz-upgrades-unsafe-allow-reachable":"delegatecall","details":"Upgrade the implementation of the proxy to `newImplementation`, and subsequently execute the function call encoded in `data`. Calls {_authorizeUpgrade}. Emits an {Upgraded} event."},"vote(uint256)":{"details":"This function can only be called on the last day of the epoch.      It updates the vote timestamp and calls the internal _vote function.","params":{"tokenId":"The ID of the loan (NFT) for which the vote is being cast."}}},"version":1},"userdoc":{"errors":{"TokenNotLocked()":[{"notice":"ERROR CODES "}]},"kind":"user","methods":{"activeAssets()":{"notice":"Retrieves the total amount of active assets (outstanding capital)."},"claim(uint256,address[],address[][])":{"notice":"Claims rewards for a specific loan and handles the distribution of rewards."},"claimCollateral(uint256)":{"notice":"Allows the borrower to claim their collateral (veNFT) after the loan is fully repaid."},"getLenderPremium()":{"notice":"Retrieves the lender premium percentage."},"getLoanDetails(uint256)":{"notice":"Retrieves the loan details for a specific token ID."},"getMaxLoan(uint256)":{"notice":"Calculates the maximum loan amount that can be borrowed for a given token ID."},"getProtocolFee()":{"notice":"Retrieves the protocol fee percentage."},"getRewardsRate()":{"notice":"Retrieves the rewards rate for the current epoch."},"getZeroBalanceFee()":{"notice":"Retrieves the zero balance fee percentage."},"incentivizeVault(uint256)":{"notice":"Transfers a specified amount of USDC from the caller to the vault and records the rewards."},"increaseAmount(uint256,uint256)":{"notice":"Increases the locked amount of a veNFT token."},"lastEpochReward()":{"notice":"Retrieves the rewards for the current epoch."},"merge(uint256)":{"notice":"Allows the owner to merge the managed NFT with a specified token ID."},"pay(uint256,uint256)":{"notice":"Allows a borrower to make a payment towards their loan."},"renounceOwnership()":{"notice":"Overrides the renounceOwnership function to prevent the owner from renouncing ownership."},"requestLoan(uint256,uint256,uint8,uint256,address,bool,bool)":{"notice":"Allows the owner of a token to request a loan by locking the token as collateral."},"setDefaultPools(address[],uint256[])":{"notice":"Allows the owner to set the default pools and their respective weights."},"setManagedNft(uint256)":{"notice":"Sets the managed NFT for the contract and initializes loan details for the given token ID."},"setMarketDiamond(address)":{"notice":"Market Diamond getter/setter (upgrade-safe via ERC-7201 storage) "},"setMultiplier(uint256)":{"notice":"Sets the multiplier value for the contract."},"vote(uint256)":{"notice":"Allows the borrower to vote on the default pools for their loan."}},"version":1}},"settings":{"compilationTarget":{"src/Blackhole/BlackholeLoan.sol":"BlackholeLoan"},"evmVersion":"cancun","libraries":{},"metadata":{"bytecodeHash":"ipfs"},"optimizer":{"enabled":true,"runs":500},"remappings":[":@openzeppelin/contracts-upgradeable/=lib/openzeppelin-contracts-upgradeable/contra